        "original_id": "36c61779-3651-5bd4-b760-9e2f616f8e6f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Attractions: Monsters, Inc. Laugh Floor, The Timekeeper\n- Places: Magic Kingdom, Walt Disney World Resort, Tomorrowland\n- Concepts: Circle-Vision 360° film\n\nFacts:\n- The Timekeeper, also known as From Time to Time and Un Voyage à Travers le Temps, was a 1992 Circle-Vision 360° film presented at three Disney parks around the world.\n- Monsters, Inc. Laugh Floor is an attraction in Magic Kingdom, a theme park at Walt Disney World Resort.\n- Monsters, Inc. Laugh Floor opened on April 2, 2007 in Magic Kingdom's Tomorrowland section.\n- Monsters, Inc. Laugh Floor replaced the Circle-Vision attraction The Timekeeper in Tomorrowland.",
